{"unit_id":"pengls__dsh-quick-view#card-zh","repo":"pengls/dsh-quick-view","commit":"e102ac94a1f655d021ee490410c4b45db94f26b9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-quick-view 是 DSH 网页客户端的会话导航插件，在会话界面右侧显示可悬浮展开的历史输入导航器。它通过 conversation.session.header.utilities 界面槽注册面板，从当前会话读取用户消息并为每条消息生成简短预览。用户悬停可展开文本列表，点击条目即可滚动到对应消息；当前最后一条输入默认高亮，手动选择后会更新选中标记。它适合在较长的 DSH 对话中快速找回先前提问。需要 DSH web profile 和兼容的 Web 客户端，不需要额外密钥或服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:41-49","src/client/QuickViewPanel.tsx:192-247"]}
{"unit_id":"pengls__dsh-quick-view#card-en","repo":"pengls/dsh-quick-view","commit":"e102ac94a1f655d021ee490410c4b45db94f26b9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-quick-view is a DSH web plugin with a floating navigator for prior user inputs. It lists short previews beside the conversation; hover to expand and click an entry to scroll to that message. The latest input is selected by default. It requires a DSH web profile, with no extra key or service.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:41-49","src/client/QuickViewPanel.tsx:192-247"]}
