{"unit_id":"pengls__dsh-quick-view#feature-1","repo":"pengls/dsh-quick-view","commit":"e102ac94a1f655d021ee490410c4b45db94f26b9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-quick-view 的功能「历史输入预览」：用户消息会按会话顺序列出，文本内容压缩成最多 80 个字符的单行预览；非文本内容不加入预览。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/QuickViewPanel.tsx:49-73"]}
